      <h1>{{ resort.short }} Resort: <em>The Full Guide</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Island Tower is the newer Disney Vacation Club tower at the Polynesian, on Seven Seas Lagoon. Duo Studios sleep two; Tower Deluxe Studios sleep four; one-bedroom villas sleep five; two-bedroom villas sleep nine; penthouses sleep eight. Wailulu Bar & Grill is in the tower lobby. You use the Polynesian monorail and the boat to Magic Kingdom.</p>
