    <p>In 2026, at full price with 12.5% tax included, Duo Studios ran about $575 to $1,276, Tower Deluxe Studios about $771 to $1,855, one-bedroom villas about $1,110 to $2,465, the listed two-bedroom Theme Park View villa about $1,904 to $3,386, and penthouses about $2,861 to $6,182, depending on the view and the dates.</p>
