  <section id="dining">
    <h2>Dining</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Wailulu Bar &amp; Grill</strong> is in the Island Tower lobby. Disney's official page lists a quick-service, grab-and-go breakfast from 7:00 a.m. to 11:00 a.m., and table-service lunch and dinner from an all-day menu, with indoor and outdoor seating. Check in at the podium in the lobby. Official text says parking for reservations is at Disney's Polynesian Village Resort, not at Island Tower, and that fireworks viewing is not guaranteed. <span class="verify">[verify lunch and dinner hours]</span></li>
      <li>Tower guests can also use the Polynesian Village restaurants. See the <a href="/resorts/polynesian-village-resort/">Polynesian Village full guide</a> for 'Ohana, Kona Cafe and Capt. Cook's. <span class="verify">[verify hours still current]</span></li>
    </ul>
    <span class="ryan">[Ryan: your go-to meal at Wailulu or next door, and one thing you'd skip.]</span>
