  <section class="procon" id="pros-cons">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Pros</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Newer tower on the monorail loop, with Wailulu in the lobby</li>
        <li>Duo Studios for two people, at a lower rack range than a Deluxe Studio</li>
        <li>Theme Park Views of Magic Kingdom and Seven Seas Lagoon on several categories</li>
        <li>No extra-adult charge up to the listed occupancy</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Cons</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Tower Deluxe Studios sleep four, not five</li>
        <li>Dining parking is not at the tower, per official text</li>
        <li>Fireworks are not guaranteed with a Wailulu reservation</li>
        <li>EPCOT is a monorail transfer; the other parks are buses</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
