    <h2>Booking and value tips</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>If you need five people in a studio, look at a longhouse Deluxe Studio,</strong> not a Tower Deluxe Studio.</li>
      <li><strong>The 2026 cash-rate table we used listed a two-bedroom villa only in Theme Park View.</strong> If you need another view, confirm current availability with Disney before you assume it is for sale at cash rates.</li>
      <li><strong>Disney Vacation Club members book with points; cash rates are full rack prices,</strong> tax included, from the 2026 published ranges above.</li>
